+# Repository rules
+
+Run `npm run check` locally; CI runs the same command.
+
+| Rule | Enforcement |
+| --- | --- |
+| Visual state classes must match current props/state during render, including initial render and toggling both ways. | `src/visualState.test.tsx` asserts classes synchronously without waiting for timers; runs in `npm run check` locally and in CI. |
